{% comment %}
  Fit guide note — ibBan  (MOVED)

  This snippet is now a no-op on purpose.

  The fit guide row (product metafield custom.fit_guide) is rendered as the
  first row of the unified product card in 'gn-shipping-bar', so that the fit
  note, the shipping rate and the delivery estimate share one card with
  hairline dividers instead of sitting in three separate boxes.

  It could not stay here: this snippet and the shipping bar are rendered by
  two different Custom Liquid blocks, and two separate block wrappers cannot
  be joined into one bordered card reliably — especially since the metafield
  is empty on most products, which would leave the card visibly cut off.

  The Custom Liquid block that calls this snippet (custom_liquid_sizewarn) is
  left in place and simply outputs nothing. The old red "Please check the Size
  Guide before ordering" warning was removed on 28 Aug 2026.

  To change the fit row, edit 'gn-shipping-bar'.
{% endcomment %}
